{
    "a_galaxy_workflow": "true",
    "annotation": "This Galaxy workflow performs cluster annotation and cell-type mapping for single-cell RNA-seq data from a glioma co-culture system (GLICO). Starting from an AnnData (.h5ad) input, it generates a standardized panel of Scanpy visualizations \u2014 dot plots, UMAPs, and matrix plots \u2014 grouped by leiden clusters to assess expression of canonical marker genes for five cell populations: tumor/glioma cells (SOX2, NES, VIM, GFAP, EGFR, PTPRZ1), astrocytes (AQP4, ALDH1L1, GFAP), microglia/macrophages (AIF1, CD68, P2RY12, TMEM119), oligodendrocytes (MBP, MOG, PLP1), and endothelial cells (PECAM1, VWF, CDH5) . An overview dot plot of all markers, UMAPs colored by leiden cluster and sample, and a general AnnData inspection step support quality control and interpretation . The workflow enables consistent, reproducible annotation of clusters by cell type across co-culture samples.",
    "comments": [
